{"id":"3bf4287c83498be0","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-dense-open-family.md","title":"ZFC Dense Open Family","display":"df-zfc-dense-open-family — ZFC Dense Open Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-dense-open-family"],"display":"df-zfc-dense-open-family — ZFC Dense Open Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-dense-open-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-dense-open-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-dense-open-family — ZFC Dense Open Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d259411e9c522740\" href=\"?note=d259411e9c522740\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d259411e9c522740\" href=\"?note=d259411e9c522740\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d259411e9c522740","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d259411e9c522740","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-open-dense-subset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dense\\text{-}open\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S(\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\mathrm{OpenDenseSubset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})","display":true}],"bytes":1070,"backlinks":[{"id":"287ea7fe632b00c1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseOpenFamily}_S$ (order-explicit dense-open-family predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-dense-open-family]])"},{"id":"a48ce5ef